# Everglade's bindings for `coax wgsl verse/everglade/gpu.coax` (coax/web/wgsl-module.coax):
# NAME GROUP BINDING, and `uniform COUNT` for a []f32 read as a uniform block of COUNT vec4fs.
# They are coax/web/host.js's layouts: group 0 the frame's uniforms; group 1 the scene (or
# the bloom's or the post's inputs, each pass its own); group 2 the shadow map; group 3
# the water's copy of the scene. u is everglade.coax's U block: 575 rows (marks end it at 2300 floats).
u 0 0 uniform 575
vertices 1 0
heights 1 1
objects 1 2
pose 1 3
water_nodes 1 4
sheets 1 5
sheet 1 6
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
water_scene 3 0
water_scene_depth 3 1
bloom_src 1 0
bloom_lin 1 1
bloom_step 1 2 uniform 1
post_light 1 0
post_quarter 1 1
post_eighth 1 2
post_aux 1 3
post_depth 1 4
post_lin 1 5
